sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Data owner (member)
    participant P as ZK prover (off-chain)
    participant D as Data chaincode CC_D (members)
    participant M as Members Org1 and Org2
    participant S as Attestation client (non-member)
    participant V as Verification chaincode CC_V (non-members)
    participant L as Ledger

    Note over O,P: prepare proof
    O->>P: D
    P-->>O: proof, C = sha256(D), journal = C, min, max

    Note over O,L: TX1 write private data, endorsed OR(Org1, Org2)
    O->>D: SubmitData(key, D via transient)
    D->>L: commit C public, status pending

    Note over M: binding signatures
    M->>M: each member ECDSA-signs CBMSEP-BIND-v1 | key | C
    M-->>S: sigma = member signatures (requiredMembers = 2)

    Note over S,V: TX2 attest, endorsed OutOf(2,3)
    S->>V: Attest(key, C, sigma, proof, publicIn)
    V->>V: verify binding (members co-signed C, pinned CA roots)
    V->>V: verify STARK proof (journal head = C, journal tail = publicIn, image id pinned)
    Note over V: no private-read API, D never accessed
    V->>L: commit attestation (status attested, submittedBy, proofDigest)
    V-->>S: Attest OK
